OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAfter a fine
OL,6,Fend to the day, it will stay dry with
OL,7,Fvariable amounts of cloud and clear
OL,8,Fspells. A cooler night for many,
OL,9,Fespecially in rural areas. Light winds
OL,10,Faway from hills and coasts where it
OL,11,Fwill remain breezy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA cool start, but otherwise a
OL,14,Ffine day ahead with variable cloud and
OL,15,Fbright or sunny spells for many.
OL,16,FBreezy over hills and coasts, easing
OL,17,Flater. Temperatures around normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
