OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FFine
OL,6,Fon Monday with variable cloud and
OL,7,Fbright or sunny spells. Feeling warmer
OL,8,Fwith light winds. Dry with warm sunny
OL,9,Fspells Tuesday. Cloudier and wetter on
OL,10,FWednesday. Some cool nights.
